sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant App as Electron Main
    participant Daemon as Go Daemon
    participant Server as ContentCloud Server
    participant UI as Renderer

    User->>App: 启动 Desktop
    App->>App: 单实例与应用版本检查
    App->>Daemon: 读取发现文件并探测健康
    alt Daemon 未运行
        App->>Daemon: 启动用户级服务
    end
    App->>Daemon: 协商 Desktop API 版本
    Daemon->>Server: 恢复设备控制通道和事件游标
    Daemon-->>App: health + bindings
    App-->>UI: 经过 Preload 的 bootstrap
    UI->>App: 请求项目快照
    App->>Daemon: GET snapshot
    Daemon-->>App: DesktopProjectView
    App-->>UI: 校验后的投影
    Daemon-->>App: snapshot invalidated
    App-->>UI: snapshot changed
    User->>App: 关闭窗口
    App-->>Daemon: detach UI session
    Note over Daemon,Server: Daemon 可继续已准入的同步与执行
